  "filled_passage": "My (1) cousin has a pet duck. Last month, her family had to spend a weekend away, so the duck stayed at our house. Its (2) feathers were bright (3) yellow, with a little white mark on its head. I had seen it in photographs, but it looked much smaller beside our kitchen door.\n\nMum put a clean box in a quiet (4) corner of the room. We gave the duck fresh (5) water in a shallow bowl. We kept the door closed (6) because the cat from next door often came into our garden. The duck was used to my cousin's voice, so she spoke to it (7) softly on the phone before she left.\n\nOn Sunday morning, we took the duck (8) outside with Mum and sat beside it in the enclosed garden. It walked around our feet and then settled beside the bowl. My cousin (9) looks after her duck carefully when she is at home, and she had written down what it needed.\n\nShe returned on Sunday evening. She visits the duck (10) every afternoon after school. I enjoyed having a visitor, but I was also glad that it could go back to the person it knew best.",
